  "releaseNotes": "\u2022 Lights out, alarms on: Set alarms for individual race sessions\n\u2022 Your voice, the team radio: Ask Siri for the next race or your favourites, rate the latest race, and start Live Activities. Plus, Spotlight search for drivers, teams and race schedules.\n\u2022 The season, at a glance: New Season Calendar widget for Ultra, plus XL My Team and News widgets on iOS 27.\n\u2022 More room in the cockpit: Resizable iPad layouts and smoother navigation across your race weekend essentials.\n\u2022 Live timing, fresh livery: Refined Live Activities with translucent backgrounds, updated flags and clearer layouts. Practice and qualifying images now display correctly too.\n\u2022 Five more languages on the radio: Polish, European Portuguese, Vietnamese, Thai and Ukrainian, plus refreshed translations across the app and widgets.\n\u2022 Pit-stop polish: Fixed dashboard card layouts and tidied up Debrief and standings views.\n\u2022 Bug fixes and performance improvements",
