  "description": "Join over 4 million fans with Box Box Club, the ultimate F1 companion app for live race updates, Formula 1 widgets, race schedules, driver stats, championship standings, race ratings, reviews, and breaking motorsport news.\n\nFollow every Formula 1, Formula 2, Formula 3, and F1 Academy race with beautifully designed Home Screen, Lock Screen, and Apple Watch widgets, personalised notifications, live timing, in-depth statistics, and community race ratings that let you see how fans scored every Grand Prix.\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Live F1 race updates and session tracking\n\u2022 Rate and review every race weekend\n\u2022 Personalised widgets and race notifications\n\u2022 Race weekend schedule with countdowns in your local time\n\u2022 Live Driver Championship (WDC) and Constructor Championship (WCC) standings\n\u2022 Compare drivers with Head-to-Head season and career statistics\n\u2022 Detailed driver, team, and circuit statistics\n\u2022 Breaking Formula 1 news, guides, glossary, and facts\n\u2022 Support for Formula 1, Formula 2, Formula 3, and F1 Academy\n\nWidgets\n\nCustomise your Home Screen, Lock Screen, and Apple Watch with widgets for:\n\n\u2022 Live race updates and standings\n\u2022 Race schedule and countdown\n\u2022 Driver Championship standings\n\u2022 Constructor Championship standings\n\u2022 Favourite driver and team\n\u2022 Driver photos and team badges\n\nAvailable in Small, Medium, and Large widget sizes.\n\nSupports Light, Dark, Clear, and Tinted widget styles on iPhone and iPad.\n\nDownload Box Box today and never miss another Formula 1 race.\n\nFor details on our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use, please visit:\n\n- https://boxbox.club/Privacy.html\n- https://boxbox.club/Terms.html\n\n----\n\nDisclaimer\n\nBox Box Club is an independent, unofficial Formula 1 companion app and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Formula One, Formula One Licensing B.V., the FIA, any Formula 1 team, or any Formula 1 driver.\n\nF1\u00ae, Formula 1\u00ae, FORMULA ONE\u00ae, FIA Formula One World Championship\u00ae, Grand Prix\u00ae, and related trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Team names, including McLaren, Mercedes-AMG PETRONAS, Scuderia Ferrari, Red Bull Racing, Williams, Alpine, Aston Martin, Haas, Racing Bulls (VCARB), and Stake F1 Team Kick Sauber, along with driver names including Lewis Hamilton, Max Verstappen, Charles Leclerc, Lando Norris, Oscar Piastri, George Russell, Kimi Antonelli, Carlos Sainz, Alexander Albon, Fernando Alonso, Lance Stroll, Pierre Gasly, Franco Colapinto, Esteban Ocon, Oliver Bearman, Yuki Tsunoda, Isack Hadjar, Liam Lawson, Gabriel Bortoleto, and Nico H\u00fclkenberg, are used solely for editorial and informational purposes. All trademarks, logos, images, and other intellectual property remain the property of their respective owners and do not imply any endorsement, sponsorship, or affiliation with Box Box.",
